  "title": "Tender Flank Steak",
  "description": "It&#39;s not difficult to make a flavorful and tender flank steak — just marinate it overnight in a mixture of garlic, soy sauce, and Worcestershire.",
  "authors": [
    "Renee Manz"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-06-04T09:50:06-04:00",
